From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Araceae Runtime <runtime@araceae.invalid>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:46:13 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Offer apply_patch as a JSON function tool

Restore the function form of apply_patch for models that cannot produce
grammar-constrained custom tool calls:

- ApplyPatchToolType::Function exposes apply_patch as a function whose
  single `input` string carries the patch text
- the handler accepts function and custom payloads alike and reuses the same
  parsing, approval, hooks, and file change events
- the top-level apply_patch_tool_type setting (`function`, `freeform`, or
  `none`) overrides model metadata, including the fallback metadata used for
  unknown models

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
